            <sparkle:version>2.0.4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapline 2.0.4</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Settings, History, the annotation editor, the trim editor and the text view now appear in &#8984;-Tab and the Dock while they are open, so you can switch back to a window after moving to another app. They were previously unreachable once Snapline was no longer frontmost.</li>
  <li>A Window menu lists every open Snapline window, as a second way back to one.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
